# OSUSER PLUGIN - the OS user and group backend behind /config/osuser and /config/osgroup
#
#        eight defined methods are mandatory, each returns <True|False>,<message|dict>:
#        - list_users
#        - get_user(name)
#        - update_user(name, **fields)
#        - delete_user(name)
#        - list_groups
#        - get_group(name)
#        - update_group(name, **fields)
#        - delete_group(name)
#
# Loaded by name, plugins/osuser/obol.py. There is no search path.
